# === Top-level ignores ===
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
*.bak
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*~
*.agdai
project/
# The nix shellHook writes the Agda config (libraries, defaults) into ./agda
# at the repository root.  Anchored with a leading slash: a bare `agda/`
# matches at any depth, so it also covered agda-dojang/agda/, the whole
# agda-dojang source tree, and data/agda/.
/agda/

# === Data outputs ===
ml-pipeline/data/
strux-driver/output/
data/agda-algebras/
data/agda-stdlib/
data/corpora-metadata/
data/corpora/
data/*.jsonl
# Benchmark evaluation reports (regenerated by `make eval-benchmark`)
data/benchmarks/reports/
# The demo site (issue 85): `make demo-data` writes the first, `make
# demo-site` the second, both from the committed reports/agent-bench/ archive.
data/demo/
/site/
# The project site (issue 169): `make site` renders MkDocs around the demo
# into this tree, with the demo copied under public/demo/.
/public/

# === Logs ===
*.log
logs/

